    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Normalizes the incoming lead and builds a template-based draft reply.\n// No credentials or external calls needed. Edit the TEMPLATES below to match your voice.\nconst cfg = $('Config').first().json;\n\nconst TEMPLATES = {\n  pricing: (l) => `Thanks for asking about pricing${l.company ? ' for ' + l.company : ''}. ` +\n    `Pricing depends on scope, so the fastest way to a real number is a short call. ` +\n    `Could you share roughly what you need and your timeline? I'll come back with options.`,\n  demo: (l) => `Happy to walk you through it. ` +\n    `What are two or three times that work for you this week or next? ` +\n    `If you share what you're hoping to see, I'll tailor the walkthrough.`,\n  support: (l) => `Sorry you're running into this. ` +\n    `Could you send the steps you took, what you expected, and what happened instead (a screenshot helps)? ` +\n    `I'll look into it as soon as I have that.`,\n  partnership: (l) => `Thanks for reaching out about working together${l.company ? ' with ' + l.company : ''}. ` +\n    `Could you share a bit more about what you have in mind and who's involved on your side? ` +\n    `Then we can see if a call makes sense.`,\n  general: (l) => `Thanks for getting in touch. ` +\n    `I've read your note and want to make sure I answer the right question. ` +\n    `Could you tell me a little more about what you're looking for?`,\n};\n\nconst RULES = [\n  ['pricing', /\\b(price|pricing|cost|quote|budget|rates?|how much)\\b/i],\n  ['demo', /\\b(demo|walk ?through|call|meeting|schedule)\\b/i],\n  ['support', /\\b(bug|error|broken|issue|problem|not working|help)\\b/i],\n  ['partnership', /\\b(partner|partnership|collaborat|integration|resell|affiliate)\\b/i],\n];\n\nconst out = [];\nfor (const item of $input.all()) {\n  // Webhook node puts the POST body under `body`; also accept a flat object.\n  const src = item.json.body ?? item.json;\n  const name = String(src.name ?? '').trim();\n  const email = String(src.email ?? '').trim().toLowerCase();\n  const message = String(src.message ?? '').trim();\n  const company = String(src.company ?? '').trim();\n\n  if (!email || !/^[^\\s@]+@[^\\s@]+\\.[^\\s@]+$/.test(email)) {\n    throw new Error(`Invalid or missing \"email\" in payload: ${JSON.stringify(src)}`);\n  }\n  if (!message) {\n    throw new Error('Missing \"message\" in payload');\n  }\n\n  const intent = (RULES.find(([, re]) => re.test(message)) ?? ['general'])[0];\n  const firstName = name.split(/\\s+/)[0] || 'there';\n  const lead = { name, firstName, email, message, company, intent };\n\n  const draft = `Hi ${firstName},\\n\\n${TEMPLATES[intent](lead)}\\n\\n${cfg.signature}`;\n  const subject = `Re: ${cfg.subjectPrefix}${company ? ' (' + company + ')' : ''}`;\n\n  out.push({ json: { ...lead, subject, draft, receivedAt: new Date().toISOString() } });\n}\nreturn out;\n"
      },
      "id": "0f2b8d32-2126-5536-a5ca-b511324f0202",
      "name": "Build Draft (template)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
